        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065770/extras/64a97bab36c24f8c9d99b14696ee416e.avif?t=1781537465\" width=1024 height=432 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EraClicker</strong> is an incremental game where you generate an absurd amount of energy and advance through different eras. Each era brings new buildings, upgrades, and unique achievements. Travel through time, enjoy the changes, and of course, click a lot on this journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can expect from EraClicker:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 839 upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 432 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 eras availables at the moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events that can boost your energy production</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EraClicker</strong> is an incremental game where you generate an absurd amount of energy and advance through different eras. Each era brings new buildings, upgrades, and unique achievements. Travel through time, enjoy the changes, and of course, click a lot on this journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can expect from EraClicker:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 839 upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 432 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 eras availables at the moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events that can boost your energy production</p></li></ul>",
